### Bundled audio model — Kokoro-82M

All audio bundled with the application under
`duo-android/app/src/main/assets/audio/` was **generated** by this project using
the Kokoro-82M text-to-speech model:

    Kokoro-82M (v1.0), hexgrad/Kokoro-82M — Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M

The model weights are licensed Apache-2.0, which permits redistribution of
both the weights and the audio derived from them. The generated speech is
therefore covered by the same permissive terms. No recorded human speech is
redistributed in the application. Details of the generation pipeline, the
grapheme-to-phoneme front-ends and the verification passes are recorded in
[`docs/kokoro-tts.md`](docs/kokoro-tts.md).

### Curriculum content

The Spanish and Japanese curriculum shipped in the application is **hand-
authored original content** written for this project. No third-party corpus
text — Tatoeba, Kaikki/Wiktionary, EDRDG, Common Voice or any other source — is
bundled in the application, so no corpus attribution obligation arises for the
shipped curriculum. [`docs/content-sourcing.md`](docs/content-sourcing.md)
describes a research/design pipeline that was considered and not adopted; it is
a historical design record, **not** a provenance record for shipped content.
